# Native specialist Settings, source locks, multiline drafts and explicit saves.
size 1280x900
file .agents/skillsets/auditor/SPECIALIST.md <<END
---
name: auditor
description: Audit security-sensitive changes
limits: read-only
---
Inspect trust boundaries and report concrete findings.
END
keys <C-;>:Settings<CR>
wait-for Appearance
keys }}}}}}
wait-for Create specialist
shot specialists-list
keys <CR>
wait-for Instructions
shot specialist-new
keys <CR>
type reviewer
keys <CR>j<CR>
type Review changes for bugs
keys <CR>j<CR>
type Review changes carefully.
keys <C-j>
type Report concrete bugs with file references.
shot specialist-instructions
keys <CR><C-s>
wait-for Specialist saved
shot specialist-saved
# Newly saved roles reopen in the same editor, keeping their model defaults.
keys G<CR>
wait-for Instructions
shot specialist-edit
size 560x780
shot specialist-narrow
